@startuml
note across
Scenario 3 – Contextual Route Description
"This sequence diagram illustrates the internal contextual description of route
candidates performed by SafeNav. This scenario is automatically triggered by
the API Layer after route candidates are generated and may be skipped depending
on system configuration or availability of contextual data."
end note

participant "API Layer" as API
participant "Geospatial Engine" as GE
participant "Data Management" as DM
participant "Meteo Data Source" as Meteo
participant "Open Data Source" as OpenData

API -> GE : I_GeospatialService: get routes context description\n(RouteCandidates)

GE -> DM : I_ContextDataAcces: request weather data
DM -> Meteo : I_OpenDataAcces: fetch weather conditions
Meteo --> DM : I_OpenDataAcces: WeatherData
DM --> GE : I_ContextDataAcces: WeatherData

GE -> DM : I_ContextDataAcces: request urban context data
DM -> OpenData : I_OpenDataAcces: fetch urban data
OpenData --> DM : I_OpenDataAcces: UrbanData
DM --> GE : I_ContextDataAcces: UrbanData

GE --> GE : **Analyze Data obtain context representation**

GE --> API : I_GeospatialService: routes context

@enduml
